  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this Project is to promote better access to health services for rural and underserved populations in Morocco as evidenced by an increase in the number of patients who benefit from necessary diagnostic laboratory tests from a baseline of zero (0) to 200 by the end of the Project.</narrative>
